Included benchmark corpus: Model Context Protocol (MCP) specification
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
benchmarks/corpora/mcp-spec-2026-07-28/ holds 22 pages of the MCP specification,
read at tag 2026-07-28 of https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/modelcontextprotocol
(commit 5f5440bb26a62e2cf3440b92da5a667efa03b267). The pages keep their upstream bytes
and repository-relative paths; manifest.json records each file's SHA-256 and upstream
git blob id. No page was modified.

Model Context Protocol specification, (c) Anthropic, PBC and contributors.
The corpus is not licensed under this product's license. Its terms are in
benchmarks/corpora/mcp-spec-2026-07-28/LICENSE (Apache-2.0, with the project's notice
on MIT contributions and CC-BY-4.0 documentation) and
benchmarks/corpora/mcp-spec-2026-07-28/LICENSE-MIT ("Copyright (c) 2024-2025
Anthropic, PBC and contributors"); benchmarks/corpora/mcp-spec-2026-07-28/README.md
describes the selection.

The question sets, checklists and gold files under benchmarks/corpora/gold/ are
part of this product.

